<title>USA: National Vision January same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>National Vision January same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, Ga. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Vision Associates Ltd said Thursday that total net sales for the four-week period ended Jan. 25 increased 12.0 percent to $12.3 million from $11.0 million in the year-ago period, and comparable store sales for domestic vision centers increased 8.0 percent.</p>
<p>At Jan. 25, 1997, NVAL said it operated 341 vision centers compared with 319 vision centers at Jan. 27, 1996.</p>
